DESCRIPTION:A play about women\, clothes & reclamation! Written by local p
 laywright Carole Vasta Folley with support from the Vermont Arts Council\,
  the Vermont Community Foundation\, and the National Endowment for the Art
 s\, this 90-minute play takes a deep dive into what we wear and why - tack
 ling real-world issues with a generous helping of laugh-out-loud humor. St
 ay afterwards for optional conversation with playwright and cast!\n\nSourc
 es: Vermont Public
