 kends in October 2026 at the company's permanent black-box venue\, The Rep
 \, located at 179 Commerce Street in Williston\, Vermont. The festival fea
 tures a dynamic lineup of 6 plays\, 6 directors\, and 6 distinct casts spl
 it across two consecutive weekends. To see all six short productions\, aud
 iences must attend a performance from each weekend. Tickets for the festiv
 al are $20 per weekend. Festival Schedule & Lineup Weekend 1: October 15
 –17\, 2026 The Way of All Fish (by Elaine May) Mountain Language (by Har
 old Pinter) The Author's Voice (by Richard Greenberg) Weekend 2: October 2
