BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:NEYT’s Junior Company Presents: The Phantom Tollbooth
DTSTART:20261025T190000
DTEND:20261026T160000
DTSTAMP:20261022T155525Z
UID:0d145d5aef124a44e77167a4290150@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:NEYT’s Junior Company invites audiences on a wonderfully wit
 ty adventure to journey beyond the ordinary in The Phantom Tollbooth. Base
 d on the 1961 novel by Norton Juster\, The Phantom Tollbooth follows the b
 oredom-stricken Milo on an incredible journey into a magical world of lite
 ralisms\, where idioms themselves can be allies and antagonists alike. Ass
 isted on his quest by companions like Tock the Watchdog and the Spelling B
 ee\, Milo sets out to restore the fractured Kingdom of Wisdom by mending t
 he feud between the cities of Dictionopolis and Digitopolis and saving the
  imprisoned princesses Rhyme and Reason. Filled with clever wordplay\, ima
 ginative characters\, and delightfully literal interpretations of familiar
  expressions\, The Phantom Tollbooth is an adventure for curious minds of 
 every age. Beneath its humor and whimsy is an enduring celebration of lear
 ning\, discovery\, and the possibilities waiting for anyone willing to loo
 k at the world differently. 15/17/20\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:New England Youth Theatre\, 100 Flat Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/neyts-juni
 or-company-presents-the-phantom-tollbooth-21-09-2026-01-20-34
END:VEVENT
